    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/6/66284.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "I want to talk to you know you've spoken with us on this show throughout the pandemic and early on you talked a lot about the kinds of calls your office was getting calls for help but specifically a lot about PPP, getting funding for local businesses. How has the nature of the calls for assistance that you're getting? How has that changed and what does that tell you about the needs here in the islands?",
