  {
    "episode_id": 66284,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/6/66284.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "Well, I'm of course on the appropriations committee that is the committee in Congress. It's actually the oldest committee in Congress going back to the very early years of Congress. And we are responsible for allocating federal funding for the years. So it's a very influential and wide reaching",
