  {
    "episode_id": 66284,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/6/66284.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "There are some who are saying that this should be made permanent, that this, you know, it's just for this tax year, but do you think that this should be made permanent? And also, there are some concerns that people who, as you mentioned, perhaps don't file taxes. Really, the families who perhaps need this money the most will not be able to access it. What can be done to make sure that the neediest families get this and then part two should this continue beyond this year?",
